d-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.65" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.65" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260925/zhanbao_image_1949122_1790282365_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260925/zhanbao_image_1949122_1790282365_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>葡萄牙主场1-0战胜威尔士取得欧国联开门红，本场C罗错失良机，菲利克斯打入制胜球。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/match1949125date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">哈兰德双响！挪威3-2丹麦 厄德高2助攻 霍伊伦破门难救主</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260925/zhanbao_image_1949125_1790282894_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260925/zhanbao_image_1949125_1790282894_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260925/zhanbao_image_1949125_1790282894_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>挪威3-2击败丹麦，本场哈兰德双响、厄德高两度助攻。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-24/6ab53eb12cf6anative.htm" targe