8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab549ccb9c6anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇马官方：科纳特右腿侧副韧带受伤，康复情况将得到进一步观察</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.49" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609250005062912.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.49" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.49" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609250005062912.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609250005062912.jpg"> </div><p>皇马官方进行伤情通报，表示科纳特右腿侧副韧带受伤，将进一步观察他的情况。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-25/6ab5849a579b5native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">低迷！C罗全场数据：7射2正，1次错失进球机会，仅获评5.8分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.27" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609250414304158.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.27" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.27" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609250414304158_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260925/202609250414304158_720.jpg"> </div><p>欧国联A4组第1轮，葡萄牙对阵威尔士。C罗首发出战，第67分钟被换下，获评5.8分。</p><p><a hr